=== elif else chain (1)
' ELIF kann beliebig oft verkettet werden, ELSE bleibt optional.
DIM g AS INTEGER
g = 90
IF g >= 90 THEN
    PRINT "A"
ELIF g >= 80 THEN
    PRINT "B"
ELIF g >= 70 THEN
    PRINT "C"
END IF
--- erwartet
A

=== elif else chain (2)
